{"sha":"ffe9d079afa68557c581d224f1ff126e625b06e3","node_id":"C_kwDOAJZX9toAKGZmZTlkMDc5YWZhNjg1NTdjNTgxZDIyNGYxZmYxMjZlNjI1YjA2ZTM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Chris Raible","email":"chris@ghost.org","date":"2025-08-12T04:33:28Z"},"committer":{"name":"Chris Raible","email":"chris@ghost.org","date":"2025-08-12T20:13:13Z"},"message":"🐛 Fixed preview route for published post bypassing redirect to post URL (#24653)\n\nref\nhttps://linear.app/ghost/issue/ENG-2506/its-possible-to-bypass-paywall-on-a-post-by-constructing-a-preview\n\nThere was a bug in the post preview route that bypassed the normal\nredirect to the published post. The preview route should only be\naccessible for posts that are not published. This was caused by the\npost's status being stripped in some cases, which bypassed the logic to\nredirect to the published post's normal URL, and instead allowed the\npreview content to render in its entirety.","tree":{"sha":"5df4e96631bd543d5b28e7e6794ff443f4075552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TryGhost/Ghost/git/trees/5df4e96631bd543d5b28e7e6794ff443f4075552"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TryGhost/Ghost/git/commits/ffe9d079afa68557c581d224f1ff126e625b06e3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TryGhost/Ghost/commits/ffe9d079afa68557c581d224f1ff126e625b06e3","html_url":"https://github.com/TryGhost/Ghost/commit/ffe9d079afa68557c581d224f1ff126e625b06e3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TryGhost/Ghost/commits/ffe9d079afa68557c581d224f1ff126e625b06e3/comments","author":{"login":"cmraible","id":5412422,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MTI0MjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5412422?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cmraible","html_url":"https://github.com/cmraible","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cmraible/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cmraible/follo